OL,3,GNEWSAPolice force needs to 'better
OL,4,Asafeguard children'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force needs to better
OL,7,Fsafeguard children, inspectors have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FDurham Police improved how quickly it
OL,11,Fanswered calls from the public and
OL,12,Fattended incidents since its last
OL,13,Finspection by His Majesty's
OL,14,FInspectorate of Constabulary and Fire
OL,15,Fand Rescue Services (HMICFRS), but some
OL,16,Fareas still needed to improve, the
OL,17,Fwatchdog said.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
