OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice force needs to 'better
OL,4,Asafeguard children'
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors found the force was not
OL,7,Fmeeting statutory guidance to report
OL,8,Fdomestic abuse incidents that children
OL,9,Fhad experienced to schools, and that it
OL,10,Fcould do more to recognise
OL,11,Fvulnerabilities around missing
OL,12,Fchildren.
OL,14,FThe force said the assessment was fair,
OL,15,Fbut it was set against a backdrop of
OL,16,F"ever-growing demand and a legacy of
OL,17,Funderfunding".
